<title>HONG KONG: Korea Int'l Merchant sets $70 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Korea Int'l Merchant sets $70 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating rate certificate of deposit issue was announced by arranger WestLB.</p>
<p> BORROWER KOREA INTERNATIONAL MERCHANT BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$70 MLN    COUPON    6ML+50 BP   MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	   ISS PRICE PAR	   LAUNCHED  09.OCT.96</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	   CALLS     NONE	  REPLIES   23.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	   REPAYMENT BULLET	DENOMS    US$500K</p>
<p> RATINGS  NONE	   SALE LMTS STANDARD    TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	    CRS DEF   YES	   FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY S.KOREA     GOV LAW   ENGLISH     PAY DATE  --</p>
<p> MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	    LEAD MANAGERS US$6 MLN+    42 BP  ALL-IN 64 BP</p>
<p>	    SNR MANAGERS  US$4-5 MLN   39 BP  ALL-IN 63 BP</p>
<p>		   MANAGERS US$2-3 MLN   36 BP  ALL-IN 62 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGERS WESTLB ASIA PACIFIC, CHO HUNG BANK AND COMMERZBANK</p>
<p>	     EAST ASIA</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
